      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 3.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.78,
      "end_seconds": 7.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.94,
      "end_seconds": 9.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.48,
      "end_seconds": 14.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Only about ten minutes, no trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.72,
      "end_seconds": 22.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.11,
      "end_seconds": 27.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Well, I've been having no symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.37,
      "end_seconds": 31.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.44,
      "end_seconds": 35.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Ever since... since yesterday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.39,
      "end_seconds": 41.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.4,
      "end_seconds": 48.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "A five out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.5,
      "end_seconds": 52.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Has there been being a little overweight too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.93,
      "end_seconds": 55.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.84,
      "end_seconds": 56.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.96,
      "end_seconds": 80.01,
      "duration_seconds": 21.05,
      "text": "As for high blood sugar on a routine test, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About high blood sugar on a routine test, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.71,
      "end_seconds": 83.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Has there been any thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.88,
      "end_seconds": 86.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "No thirst, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.29,
      "end_seconds": 91.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Any frequent urination, weight loss or blurred vision at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.65,
      "end_seconds": 97.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "No, no frequent urination, weight loss or blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.67,
      "end_seconds": 100.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.88,
      "end_seconds": 105.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, you know, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.38,
      "end_seconds": 111.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.59,
      "end_seconds": 113.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.2,
      "end_seconds": 116.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.89,
      "end_seconds": 121.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.61,
      "end_seconds": 124.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.19,
      "end_seconds": 132.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.38,
      "end_seconds": 134.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.79,
      "end_seconds": 141.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.48,
      "end_seconds": 145.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.07,
      "end_seconds": 149.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.87,
      "end_seconds": 153.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.0,
      "end_seconds": 158.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.72,
      "end_seconds": 180.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.81,
      "end_seconds": 183.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.3,
      "end_seconds": 186.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.16,
      "end_seconds": 190.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Mm, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.97,
      "end_seconds": 209.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.69,
      "end_seconds": 220.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "Rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol. It's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.57,
      "end_seconds": 232.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.6,
      "end_seconds": 240.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for nearly five years now. Heart disease, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.52,
      "end_seconds": 251.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "Alright, high cholesterol, that matches what I have here. Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.59,
      "end_seconds": 267.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Alright, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.76,
      "end_seconds": 299.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "text": "Okay: height 154 centimetres, BMI works out to 28.3. And weight 67 kilos, BP is 128 over 72, pulse 85, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.87,
      "end_seconds": 306.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.0,
      "end_seconds": 315.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.67,
      "end_seconds": 320.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.62,
      "end_seconds": 321.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.45,
      "end_seconds": 323.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.53,
      "end_seconds": 339.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and heart rate are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.55,
      "end_seconds": 351.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with prediabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.29,
      "end_seconds": 356.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.43,
      "end_seconds": 380.47,
      "duration_seconds": 23.04,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with prediabetes do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for a repeat HbA1c because of prediabetes. Walk thirty minutes daily, cut sugary drinks and aim to lose five percent of your weight. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.16,
      "end_seconds": 384.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Thank you, um, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.52,
      "end_seconds": 386.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
